<title>USA: USDA adds El Salvador, Panama to SCGP program.</title>
<headline>USDA adds El Salvador, Panama to SCGP program.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Tuesday said it amended the credit guarantees to Guatemala under the Supplier Credit Guarantee Program to include El Salvador and Panama as eligible destinations.</p>
<p>USDA said the total allocation for the newly establish Central America program was $7.9 million for fiscal year 1997.</p>
